# Files that must NOT be sent to Cloud Build / baked into the image.
# Most important line in this file: the secret stays out of the container —
# in the cloud, the radar gets its token from Secret Manager, not a file.
.env

# Dead weight (the image needs none of this to run):
.git
.venv
__pycache__
.claude
*.md
phases/
main.py
seed_workspace.py
